  <metadata>
    <title>Run the Dataverse proxy routes AS THE CALLER: POST /api/dataverse/fetch and GET /api/dataverse/record/{entityLogicalName}/{id} stop reading app-only, so Dataverse row security, business-unit scope, sharing and field-level security apply (route sweep findings #9 and #10, both critical)</title>
    <phase>Session 27 — route authorization sweep (owner round 9, 2026-10-03)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Authorization-path .cs change on two live, unconditionally mapped BFF routes (Program.cs:264-265). Tags bff-api, auth, security. Closes an org-wide row and column disclosure to any signed-in workforce user.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Security/auth-sensitive: the fix changes the identity a shared Dataverse read service runs under, while the SAME two services must keep running app-only for the external contact seam (contacts cannot be impersonated). It adds the second SDK impersonation entry point to a shared fail-closed helper, it must keep "unknown" and "denied" indistinguishable through Dataverse fault codes that are only partly documented, and the route guard (task 074/167) cannot see this class of defect by itself.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits src/server/shared/Spaarke.Dataverse/DataverseImpersonation.cs (the shared fail-closed impersonation helper behind every impersonated read; other round-9 surface tasks that add impersonated reads will want the same SDK entry point, and this task's new arch guard rule 1 will fail any of them that assigns CallerId anywhere else). Edits Services/Dataverse/FetchService.cs and RecordService.cs, which the external module seam (Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalModuleDataEndpoints.cs, tasks 134/157) also calls. May edit tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.cs, which task 167 and every round-9 surface task touch. Edits tests/integration/Sprk.Bff.Api.IntegrationTests/DataverseIntegrationTestFixture.cs, shared by the savedquery, metadata and gridconfiguration endpoint tests.</parallel-reason>
